# Network Topology Diagram Placeholder

This file would contain a visual network diagram showing:

- Physical layout of routers, switches, and access points
- Cable connections between devices
- VLAN segmentation
- WAN uplink connections to Layer 1/2/3
- Device locations (physical layout)

Tools to create this diagram:
- Lucidchart
- Draw.io (diagrams.net)
- Microsoft Visio
- Network topology mapping software (SolarWinds, Spiceworks)

Example structure:

```
                  [Internet/WAN]
                  via Layer 1/2/3
                        |
                  [Primary Router]
                    10.0.0.1
                        |
        ┌───────────────┼───────────────┐
        |               |               |
   [Switch]        [Mesh AP]       [Backup Router]
   10.0.1.1        10.0.0.10          10.0.0.2
        |               |
    ┌───┴───┐      ┌────┴────┐
[Desktop] [NAS]  [Phone] [Laptop]
```

